</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d5734f8c-abdc-11f1-b5e7-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2262709064.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d5734f8c-abdc-11f1-b5e7-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2262709064.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ee70c810-abe2-11f1-afcc-31f619116af0</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:10:56 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d5734f8c-abdc-11f1-b5e7-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/063-2262709064.jpg">© Anna Moneymaker, Getty Images via AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Spotlight</category><title>Accelerating diversification: Canada seeks economic sovereignty amid Trump's 'nonsensical' posturing</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20260908-accelerating-diversification-canada-seeks-economic-sovereignty-amid-trump-s-nonsensical-posturing</link><description>
